@startuml acs-c4-container
' C4 Container — ACS (Caregivers and Access), NeuroAssist NIV
title ACS — Containers

rectangle "acs-service\nSpring Boot (Java 21), hexagonal\nAuthorization Server + Resource Server" as acs #LightBlue

database "PostgreSQL\nneuroassist_global +\nt_<tenantId> schemas" as pg
rectangle "Eureka (REG)\nservice registry" as eureka
rectangle "API Gateway (GWY)\nSpring Cloud Gateway" as gwy
rectangle "HIST (hist-service)\naudit sink" as hist
rectangle "MIG (migrations)\ncentral Flyway runner" as mig

gwy --> acs : HTTPS /acs/** \n(port 8081)
acs --> pg : JPA (global + per-tenant)
acs --> eureka : register / discover
acs --> hist : Feign/REST POST /audit\n(sync, 2s timeout)
mig --> pg : applies ACS-authored\nFlyway scripts (all schemas)

note right of acs
  No message broker (messaging disabled).
  No TechLab AI hub client.
  Blacklist + JWKS served from acs-service.
end note

@enduml
